/*
# Merlin Dynamic Island for Windows

Bring a sleek, animated Dynamic Island to the top of your Windows desktop. Merlin combines a distinctive eye-inspired design with quick access to media, system information, and a handy file shelf.

![Merlin Dynamic Island on the desktop](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerlinBilal/merlin-assets/main/masasustu-goz-goruntun.png)

## Features

### 🎵 Music Player
See what is playing, check track details and control playback directly from the island.

![Music player active](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerlinBilal/merlin-assets/main/merlin-muzik-acik.webp)

### 🎧 Waiting for Music
When no track is playing, the island displays its waiting state instead of leaving the interface feeling empty.

![Music player waiting state](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerlinBilal/merlin-assets/main/merlin-muzik-kapali.webp)

### 👁️ Animated Eye Design
Choose the eye-inspired idle look that gives Merlin its distinctive character.

![Merlin eye design](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerlinBilal/merlin-assets/main/merlin-buyuk-goz.webp)

![Compact eye design](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerlinBilal/merlin-assets/main/merlin-kucuk-goz.webp)

### 🖥️ Hardware Monitoring
Keep an eye on key system resources from a compact panel, without opening a separate monitoring window.

![System monitoring panel](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerlinBilal/merlin-assets/main/merlin-sistem.webp)

### 📁 File Shelf
A dedicated shelf gives you a quick place to work with files through the island interface.

![File shelf](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerlinBilal/merlin-assets/main/merlin-raf.webp)

### ⚙️ Settings and Personalization
Configure Merlin through its settings interface and tailor the experience to your preferences.

![Merlin settings](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerlinBilal/merlin-assets/main/merlin-ayarlar.webp)

## Designed to fit your desktop

- Compact, animated interface at the top of the screen.
- Media playback information and controls.
- Eye-style idle appearance.
- Quick access to system monitoring.
- File shelf and customizable settings.

## Requirements

- Windows 11
- [Windhawk](https://windhawk.net/)

## Privacy

Merlin Dynamic Island is a Windows customization mod. Review the source code and your configuration to understand the behavior of the version you install.

---

**Merlin Dynamic Island**  
Made by Merlinbilal.
*/
